  "result": "Perfect! All 228 tests pass. I've successfully added the overdue invoices report:\n\n**src/reports.js** - New function:\n\n**overdueInvoices(invoices, asOf)** - Generates an overdue invoices report:\n- **Filtering**:\n  - Only invoices with status 'issued' or 'partially_paid'\n  - Only invoices where dueDate is before asOf (not on the due date)\n- **Each item includes**:\n  - number: the invoice number\n  - customerId: the customer ID\n  - dueDate: the invoice's due date\n  - daysOverdue: calculated as daysBetween(dueDate, asOf)\n  - due: the balance still owed (from balanceDue)\n- **Sorting**: by daysOverdue descending (most overdue invoices first)\n- **Returns**: array sorted by most overdue first\n\n**Fixed issueInvoice**:\n- Now copies `terms` and `dueDate` from draft invoice to issued invoice\n- Ensures these fields are available for statements and reports\n\n**Tests** - 10 new tests covering:\n- Empty results when no invoices or none overdue\n- Single and multiple overdue invoices\n- Filtering draft and paid invoices (only issued/partially_paid included)\n- Partially paid invoices included\n- Correct sorting by daysOverdue (descending)\n- Accurate daysOverdue calculation\n- Boundary condition: exact due date is not overdue\n- Boundary condition: first day after due date is 1 day overdue\n\nThe report provides a clear view of which invoices are overdue and by how many days, sorted to highlight the most critical delinquencies first.",
